error[E0331]: the operator `<` can't be defined
 --> tests/ui/operator_definitions.wid:6:7
  |
6 |   def <(other: Money) -> Bool = @cents < other.cents
  |       ^ `<` comes from `<=>`
  = note: `<`, `<=`, `>` and `>=` come from `<=>`, so the two can't disagree
help: define `<=>` instead, which returns an `Int`: negative when `self` comes first, 0 when the two are equal and positive when `other` comes first
  |   def <=>(other: Money) -> Int = @cents <=> other.cents
  = see `wid explain E0331`

